[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SIP001
TITLE: Create the virtualenv and run one configured aircraft
STATEMENT: >>>
Installation shall create the project virtualenv from requirements.txt, which pins StrictDoc and pytest, and shall run make aircraft-test from the repository root. The example aircraft is config/n123ab.toml. A rejected TOML file shall not produce a flying aircraft. Acceptance is a support engineer who can run that make target and see the pytest summary.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Installation is a userspace virtualenv. It does not need elevated privileges.
<<<
DAL: E
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Plan
VERIFICATION: Review
ASSUMPTIONS: The Aircraft CSCI is a simulation. It is not connected to a real aircraft or a live facility, and this record does not claim certification authority approval.
